#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>Can I count on your help, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><else>Can I count on your help, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
